er. He proposes reforms in order to meet the goal of attracting 250,000 visitors within three months, but the crew is full of complaints.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eUMsVRChc0TX6Eh8m7frnplaQUg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eUMsVRChc0TX6Eh8m7frnplaQUg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65332/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1158937","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Though arrogant, Seiya solves problem after problem at the park. Isuzu should be happy about it, but something bothers her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ycT23y6VprVqi2EMXo3r6PhhPP7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ycT23y6VprVqi2EMXo3r6PhhPP7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65332/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1158938","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the 30-yen offer, the number of visitors slowly improves, but money is still an issue. In an attempt to find quick cash, Seiya visits Moffle, and they set off to search for a supposed treasure hidden in a cave.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/30IsfD1VYK3eh1eHx6Xk9h2ZSyO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/30IsfD1VYK3eh1eHx6Xk9h2ZSyO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65332/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1158939","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Isuzu has mixed feelings about Seiya's expert handling of the issues at the park, even having nightmares about her own work. Meanwhile, in an effort to resolve the labor shortage, she begins interviewing potential hires.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/74k0nyEwa2UPwjW6497xfdpyWKK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/74k0nyEwa2UPwjW6497xfdpyWKK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65332/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1158940","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The summer is here, and \"Splash Ocean\", the water park area, is brimming with guests as usual today. Isuzu, Muse, and the other four fairies are busy in pirate costumes. Meanwhile, Joe the shark notices something wrong in the machine room.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jj2Y0TSUBn0QPrXDF0ld74jGY1t.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jj2Y0TSUBn0QPrXDF0ld74jGY1t.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65332/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1158941","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seiya collapses from fatigue and summer cold after having been busy with managing the park for the past few days. To help Seiya, who's worried about his attendance at school, Moffle and others came up with a plan: Pretend to be Seiya by wearing Mogoot Clan's \"magical clone suit\" and attend school. However...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-11-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k59UZFWxa2VckKxqmbkJU4TvJz9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/ori